* Cells of the HyFlexPIM ADC (sar_tb.sp), PTM 65 nm bulk (../models/65nm_bulk.pm,
* nmos / pmos), L = 65 nm, VDD = 1.0 V.
.subckt inv a y vdd s=1
MP y a vdd vdd pmos w={s*260n} l=65n
MN y a 0 0 nmos w={s*130n} l=65n
.ends
.subckt nand2 a b y vdd s=1
MP1 y a vdd vdd pmos w={s*260n} l=65n
MP2 y b vdd vdd pmos w={s*260n} l=65n
MN1 y a m 0 nmos w={s*260n} l=65n
MN2 m b 0 0 nmos w={s*260n} l=65n
.ends
.subckt nand3 a b c y vdd s=1
MP1 y a vdd vdd pmos w={s*260n} l=65n
MP2 y b vdd vdd pmos w={s*260n} l=65n
MP3 y c vdd vdd pmos w={s*260n} l=65n
MN1 y a m1 0 nmos w={s*390n} l=65n
MN2 m1 b m2 0 nmos w={s*390n} l=65n
MN3 m2 c 0 0 nmos w={s*390n} l=65n
.ends
.subckt nor2 a b y vdd s=1
MP1 m a vdd vdd pmos w={s*520n} l=65n
MP2 y b m vdd pmos w={s*520n} l=65n
MN1 y a 0 0 nmos w={s*130n} l=65n
MN2 y b 0 0 nmos w={s*130n} l=65n
.ends
* SR latch (cross-coupled NAND), active-low inputs: sn = 0 sets q, rn = 0 resets q
.subckt srln sn rn q qb vdd
X1 sn qb q vdd nand2
X2 rn q qb vdd nand2
.ends
* CMOS track-and-hold switch (NMOS and PMOS in parallel, no bootstrapping, as Kull),
* en high = track
.subckt tg x y en enb vdd wn=1u wp=2u
MN x en y 0 nmos w={wn} l=65n
MP x enb y vdd pmos w={wp} l=65n
.ends
* CDAC bottom-plate driver: out = vref when c = 1, 0 when c = 0; tapered buffer
* (1, s/8, s/3, s), the last stage on vref
.subckt drv c out vref vdd s=1
X1 c n1 vdd inv s=1
X2 n1 n2 vdd inv s={max(1, s/8)}
X3 n2 n3 vdd inv s={max(1, s/3)}
MP out n3 vref vref pmos w={s*260n} l=65n
MN out n3 0 0 nmos w={s*130n} l=65n
.ends
* StrongARM latch comparator: clk high = evaluate, clk low = reset. dp / dn: buffered
* decisions, both low in reset; dp rises when inp > inn. valid = dp | dn, taken as one
* NAND of the latch nodes (decision detect).
.subckt strongarm inp inn clk dp dn valid vdd w=2
XV on op valid vdd nand2 s=2
MT  tail clk 0 0 nmos w={w*1040n} l=65n
M1  x1 inp tail 0 nmos w={w*1040n} l=65n
M2  x2 inn tail 0 nmos w={w*1040n} l=65n
M3  on op x1 0 nmos w={w*520n} l=65n
M4  op on x2 0 nmos w={w*520n} l=65n
M5  on op vdd vdd pmos w={w*520n} l=65n
M6  op on vdd vdd pmos w={w*520n} l=65n
MR1 on clk vdd vdd pmos w={w*520n} l=65n
MR2 op clk vdd vdd pmos w={w*520n} l=65n
MR3 x1 clk vdd vdd pmos w={w*260n} l=65n
MR4 x2 clk vdd vdd pmos w={w*260n} l=65n
XIP on dp vdd inv s=2
XIN op dn vdd inv s=2
.ends
